FROM node:24.20.0-trixie-slim@sha256:50c3b2f6988dfc307b86e5301d69611af31f4789bdf232863b07d3b02fe55ae0
WORKDIR /usr/src/app

RUN corepack enable

COPY package* pnpm* .pnpmfile.cjs ./
COPY ./packages/e2e-auth-server/package.json ./packages/e2e-auth-server/

WORKDIR /usr/src/app/packages/e2e-auth-server
RUN pnpm install --frozen-lockfile

COPY ./packages/e2e-auth-server ./

EXPOSE 2286
CMD ["pnpm", "run", "start"]
